<div class="complaints-page" style="background:#ffffff; min-height:100vh; padding:4rem 0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:900px; margin:0 auto; text-align:left;">
    <h1 style="font-size:2.4rem; color:#1a1a1a; margin-bottom:1rem;">📖 Complaints Book – Point Store</h1>

    <p style="font-size:1.2rem; margin-top:1rem;">In accordance with <strong>Law No. 29571 – Consumer Protection and Defense Code</strong>, and <strong>D.S. No. 011-2011-PCM</strong>, we provide our customers with this Virtual Complaints Book. At Point Store, we value your trust and are committed to handling your complaints or claims quickly and transparently.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem; margin-top:1.4rem;">🧾 What can you register here?</h2>
    <p style="font-size:1.2rem;"> <strong>Claim:</strong> Dissatisfaction directly related to a purchased product or service (for example, wrong order or delivery issue).<br>
    <strong>Complaint:</strong> Discomfort or dissatisfaction regarding customer service.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:1.4rem; margin-top:1.4rem;">📩 How to file your complaint?</h2>
    <p style="font-size:1.2rem;">Fill out the following form, and we will contact you within 15 business days, as established by Indecopi regulations.</p>

    <h3 style="font-size:1.25rem; margin-top:1rem;">Suggested Form (you can copy this to your Shopify or Google Form page):</h3>

    <div style="background:#fafafa; padding:1rem 1.2rem; border-radius:0.6rem; margin-top:1rem;">
      <h4 style="margin:0 0 0.6rem 0;">Consumer Information:</h4>
      <ul style="margin:0 0 0.8rem 1.2rem;">
        <li>Full name</li>
        <li>ID / Foreigner ID</li>
        <li>Email</li>
        <li>Phone</li>
        <li>Address</li>
      </ul>

      <h4 style="margin:0 0 0.6rem 0;">Purchase Details:</h4>
      <ul style="margin:0 0 0.8rem 1.2rem;">
        <li>Purchase date</li>
        <li>Order number</li>
        <li>Total amount</li>
      </ul>

      <h4 style="margin:0 0 0.6rem 0;">Complaint or Claim Details:</h4>
      <ul style="margin:0 0 0.8rem 1.2rem;">
        <li>Type (Claim / Complaint)</li>
        <li>Description</li>
        <li>Consumer’s request</li>
        <li>Signature / Date (automatic for virtual forms)</li>
      </ul>

      <h4 style="margin:0 0 0.6rem 0;">Supplier Information:</h4>
      <p style="margin:0 0 0.8rem 0;">Business name: Point Store S.A.C.<br>
      Email: <a href="mailto:pointstoreperu@gmail.com">pointstoreperu@gmail.com</a><br>
      WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/51965959329">+51 965 959 329</a><br>
      Location: Lima, Peru</p>
    </div>

    <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; margin-top:1rem;">⚖️ Important Note</h3>
    <p style="font-size:1.15rem;">Submitting a complaint does not prevent you from seeking other dispute resolution methods, nor does it pause any legal deadlines. Point Store will respond within the applicable legal timeframe while maintaining the confidentiality of your personal data in accordance with <strong>Law No. 29733</strong>.</p>

    <p style="font-size:1.15rem; margin-top:1.2rem;"><strong>If you prefer, you can also contact us directly via WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/51965959329" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">+51 965 959 329</a></p>
